MedDeID English synthetic model

This model is derived from FacebookAI/roberta-base, pinned at revision
e2da8e2f811d1448a5b465c236feacd80ffbac7b. The upstream model remains subject
to its own terms and attribution requirements.

No real patient notes were used for training. The model was trained on the
MedDeID English synthetic corpus and evaluated on the separate fixed synthetic
benchmark. Synthetic-benchmark results do not establish safety or performance
on real clinical data.
